# Cycle evidence: every research/cycle-*/ folder publishes only its reviewed
# summary (README.md) and verified build identities (verified-builds.json).
# Raw native reports, screenshots and private captures stay local. Files that
# were committed before this rule stay tracked; stage any new extra file with
# the force flag only after reviewing it for private writing.
/research/cycle-*/*
!/research/cycle-*/README.md
!/research/cycle-*/verified-builds.json

